## Value Proposition

### For Development Teams
```
Before DataShield:
  - Wait 3-4 weeks for masked production replica
  - Manual masking rules in Excel (error-prone)
  - Cannot refresh data without compliance review
  - Storage costs = $100K+/year
  
After DataShield:
  ✅ Get masked environment in 2-4 hours
  ✅ Deterministic masking (consistent across runs)
  ✅ Refresh data on-demand without compliance overhead
  ✅ Storage 80% smaller
  ✅ Cost: $30K-50K/year
```

### For Security & Compliance Teams
```
Before DataShield:
  - Manual audits of masking (error-prone, time-consuming)
  - Risk of PII leakage if masking fails
  - Cannot verify compliance across all environments
  - Regulatory fines if breach discovered
  
After DataShield:
  ✅ Automated audit trail (who, what, when)
  ✅ Deterministic masking = reproducible results
  ✅ Pre-flight dry-run validates all rules before execution
  ✅ Error fingerprinting (identifies masking failures early)
  ✅ Regulatory confidence (provable compliance)
```

### For Finance Teams
```
Before DataShield:
  - Infrastructure: 3-5 full production clones @ $50-150K/year
  - Management: Manual data refresh, no automation
  - Compliance: Regular audits = $20-50K/year
  
After DataShield:
  ✅ Storage: 1 small masked replica @ $10-20K/year
  ✅ Operations: Automated, no manual intervention
  ✅ Compliance: Built-in audit (reduced audit cost)
  ✅ Total: 60% cost reduction
```

