## Implementation Timeline

### Phase 1: MVP (Weeks 1-16)
```
Week 1-2:    Architecture + Spring Boot 4 setup
Week 3-6:    Core engine (Chunk processing, Resume, Parallel)
Week 7-10:   Security (FPE, Deterministic Masking, Scoped Values)
Week 11-14:  Cockpit UI (React + SSE)
Week 15-16:  Testing + documentation
Deliverable: v1.0 Beta (GitHub repo + Docker image)
```

### Phase 2: Production Ready (Weeks 17-29)
```
Week 17-20:  Schema validation, Dry-run, Virtual Relationships
Week 21-24:  Composite key support, Error fingerprinting
Week 25-27:  Monitoring (Micrometer), Kubernetes manifests
Week 28-29:  Security audit, Performance testing
Deliverable: v1.0 GA (SaaS launch)
```

### Phase 3: Scale (Weeks 30-52)
```
Week 30-35:  Sales enablement, Case studies, Docs
Week 36-40:  Channel partnerships (AWS, Consulting firms)
Week 41-45:  Marketplace integration (AWS, Azure, GCP)
Week 46-52:  Enterprise features (Kafka coordination, Debezium)
Deliverable: v1.5 (Scale-ready)
```

