## Risk Analysis & Mitigation

### Technical Risks

| Risk | Impact | Probability | Mitigation |
|------|--------|-------------|-----------|
| Virtual Threads immaturity (Java 25) | Performance degradation, instability | Medium | Thorough testing, fallback to thread pools |
| FPE algorithm limitations | Data loss on encryption/decryption | Low | Industry-standard FF1 cipher, audited |
| Composite key complexity | Pagination failures on multi-column keys | Medium | Custom JDBC reader, extensive testing |
| Referential integrity breaks | Data corruption, compliance violation | Low | Pre-flight validation, deterministic testing |

### Business Risks

| Risk | Impact | Probability | Mitigation |
|------|--------|-------------|-----------|
| Late market entry (Delphix maturity) | Hard to gain traction | Medium | Focus on cost + speed + ease-of-use |
| Customer adoption delay | Revenue miss | High | Design partner program, free trials |
| Churn (competition, dissatisfaction) | CAC > LTV | Medium | Premium support, roadmap transparency |
| Security breach (masking failure) | Regulatory fine, reputation damage | Low | Security audit, bug bounty, insurance |

